### List screens
GET http://localhost:5005/api/screens

### Editor schema (node types, props, slots, binding keys)
GET http://localhost:5005/api/screens/schema

### Get one screen
GET http://localhost:5005/api/screens/demo

### Create or replace a screen
PUT http://localhost:5005/api/screens/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"demo","name":"Demo","root":{"type":"stack","direction":"vertical","padding":4,"children":[
  {"type":"clock","format":"HH:mm","font":"Big","color":"#ffffff"},
  {"type":"label","text":"{weather.temp} degrees","color":"#ffd24a"}]}}

### Show it
POST http://localhost:5005/api/apps/screen:demo

### Delete it
DELETE http://localhost:5005/api/screens/demo
